  "body": "per the reverse-proxy docs, https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/master/docs/reverse_proxy.md, you only need to forward `/_matrix` and `/_synapse/client` to synapse.\r\n\r\nHowever, the OIDC login flow calls back to `/_synapse/oidc/callback`, so people following the documentation get a 404.\r\n\r\n",
